       "dir": "ltr",
       "code": "public static Node<int> Intersection(Node<int> Chain1, Node<int> Chain2)\n{\n    Node<int> Chain3 = null;\n    Node<int> Pos = Chain1;\n    while (Pos != null)\n    {\n        int x = Pos.GetValue();\n        if (Exists(Chain2, x) && !Exists(Chain3, x))\n            Chain3 = AddLast(Chain3, x);\n        Pos = Pos.GetNext();\n    }\n    return Chain3;\n}",
       "origin": "teacher-enrichment"
